{%- comment -%}
  Maps a product handle -> its shopable video URL (gathered from the shopable-video
  sections across the whole site, including the homepage "shop the look" carousel).
  Used as a fallback for the product page's "Watch in video" button + appended at the
  end of the gallery's product images when the product has its own / a linked video.
  Echoes the URL (or nothing). Usage:
    {%- capture v -%}{%- render 'shopable-video-map', handle: product.handle -%}{%- endcapture -%}
  To refresh: run _scan-all-shopvid.js (lists every template's shopable-video block:
  product + video_url + local_video) then _resolve-shopvid.js (resolves local_video
  filenames -> CDN mp4 urls). Picked the most product-specific clip per product.
{%- endcomment -%}
